{"line": 5, "text": "- loss = cross-entropy next token"}
{"line": 6, "text": "- frontier: dew 100, -0.5 cost, +2 on improvement, death<=0 -> gen++, wind mutate"}
{"line": 7, "text": "- humus = high loss examples for replay"}
{"line": 8, "text": "\"\"\""}
{"line": 9, "text": "import json, math, random, hashlib, time, os"}
{"line": 10, "text": "from pathlib import Path"}
{"line": 11, "text": "try: import requests; HAS_REQ=True"}
